            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Who owns Matrix Fitness?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Matrix Fitness is a brand of Johnson Health Tech, a
              Taiwan-based company that manufactures fitness equipment for
