            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How does Matrix Fitness compare to Life Fitness?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Both are genuinely commercial-pedigree brands using AC motors
              and fixed frames, and both cost meaningfully more than
